OL,3,AOne person taken to hospital after
OL,4,Abarracks fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a fire broke out at the military
OL,8,Fbarracks accommodation block in
OL,9,FCatterick Garrison.
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid multiple crews were sent at 19:48
OL,13,FBST on Thursday where the blaze was
OL,14,Ffound to be "well alight".
OL,16,FThe service said the person was taken
OL,17,Fto hospital with smoke inhalation while
OL,18,Ffire crews remained on scene until
OL,19,F02:43 BST.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
